at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ppr_ps/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c892426/uploads/origins/9e83ede4-0e59-4a66-b583-2b3db2f2b4ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f80d14b3fe9d7d2d9864419896db8353", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c892426/uploads/origins/9e83ede4-0e59-4a66-b583-2b3db2f2b4ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f80d14b3fe9d7d2d9864419896db8353, https://si.imgix.net/3c892426/uploads/origins/9e83ede4-0e59-4a66-b583-2b3db2f2b4ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=559f08e587b7aadd3402c6a94176cdd2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c892426/uploads/origins/9e83ede4-0e59-4a66-b583-2b3db2f2b4ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3164d31a3258f190a161a77842d828c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ぱりぴぃ様\nご依頼再開お待ちしておりました…！\n\n使用用途\nSNS等でのアイコン、ヘッダー使用\n個人鑑賞\n\nOC2人、クリスマス衣装です\n大人っぽくして頂きたいのと、胸は盛って頂きたいです……！！！！！！！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xBjinKsol9L8cZsGIkdHy47KpJ94PVNk\n1人目コテシ\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1J8YGcHQHH2TDfSnBiJiZOMXuGpFXjc94\n2人目コテシ\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wUxP6f5Ttu4go18x98nFsl9VDVzbZbGC\n服装\n\nこちらとなります。\n\nもしなにか不都合ありましたら再送お願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ppr_ps/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cdb727b7/uploads/origins/fbbde45d-9ce6-419a-a766-a789772b0dd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4b3599967f1db807c98a333edad2c55", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cdb727b7/uploads/origins/fbbde45d-9ce6-419a-a766-a789772b0dd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4b3599967f1db807c98a333edad2c55, https://si.imgix.net/cdb727b7/uploads/origins/fbbde45d-9ce6-419a-a766-a789772b0dd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95ac3ce920c2c7a664c0f0db7946